sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Mobile Client (Axios)
    participant RCF as RequestCorrelationFilter
    participant JAF as JwtAuthenticationFilter
    participant DS as DispatcherServlet
    participant Controller as TaskController
    participant Service as TaskService (Proxy)
    participant Repo as TaskRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 15

    Client->>RCF: HTTP POST /api/v1/tasks (Header: X-Request-ID, Bearer token)
    Note over RCF: Trích xuất / cấp phát X-Request-ID<br/>Gán MDC("requestId", requestId)
    RCF->>JAF: doFilterInternal(request, response)
    Note over JAF: Giải mã JWT HMAC-SHA256<br/>Thiết lập SecurityContextHolder
    JAF->>DS: doFilterInternal()
    DS->>Controller: createTask(@Valid @RequestBody CreateTaskRequest dto)
    Note over Controller: Xác thực Bean Validation DTO<br/>Gọi tầng Service
    Controller->>Service: createTask(dto)
    Note over Service: Transaction Proxy interceptor<br/>Mở connection, setAutoCommit(false)
    Service->>Repo: save(taskEntity)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO tasks (...) VALUES (...)
    DB-->>Repo: 1 row affected (ID generated)
    Repo-->>Service: Task (Entity persisted)
    Note over Service: Commit transaction, giải phóng connection
    Service-->>Controller: TaskResponse DTO
    Controller-->>DS: ResponseEntity<ApiResponse<TaskResponse>>
    DS-->>JAF: Response JSON (chứa traceId)
    JAF-->>RCF: Response
    Note over RCF: response.setHeader("X-Request-ID", requestId)<br/>MDC.remove("requestId")
    RCF-->>Client: HTTP 201 Created (Header: X-Request-ID)
